By the way, you know how to shop with uncontrolled teleportitis?
Drop gold on the floor before you pick anything up -- that way
if you accidentally teleport out, the price is deducted from your
credit and you don't get the shopkeeper after you.

I'm no expert, but if you stay careful uncontrolled teleportitis
doesn't
seem like it should completely harsh your game -- I just played a
Wizard who had uncontrolled teleportitis for a while (I forgot that
the Wizard quest doesn't generate lots of tengus) and aside from
one accidental shoplifting incident the worst thing that seemed to
happen was that it took longer to get to the stairs. And you'll get
telecontrol once you get the key.


